{
  "task_description": "{'component_name': 'Main Container for Multiverse Mirage', 'description': "Primary container for Multiverse Mirage implementation: AlterEgo is a cinematic, AI-powered web app that lets users explore alternate versions of their lives by entering 'what if' scenarios. It uses GPT-4o for narrative generation, Stable Diffusion for visual renders, and psychological profiling to simulate multiverse life paths. The app features a clean, immersive UI with a galaxy-themed background, interactive dashboards, and dreamlike animations. Users can chat with AI-generated characters, view emotional and life metrics, and experience their alternate lives through narrative, visuals, and sound.", 'interfaces': [], 'framework': 'react', 'platform': 'web', 'container': '{\n  "name": "Multiverse Mirage-38152 frontend Container",\n  "features": [\n    {\n      "name": "What If Scenario Input",\n      "description": "Central prompt field on the landing page for users to enter alternate life scenarios, triggering AI-powered simulations.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "AI Narrative Generation",\n      "description": "Uses OpenAI GPT-4o to generate detailed, personalized alternate life stories based on user input and psychological profile.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Visual Reality Renders",\n      "description": "Stable Diffusion generates unique, cinematic images representing key moments from the simulated life path.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Psychological Profiling",\n      "description": "Integrates MBTI/Big Five personality inputs to tailor simulations and outcomes.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Logic Flow Orchestration",\n      "description": "LangChain manages the flow and branching logic of life-path simulations.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Simulation Storage",\n      "description": "Stores user simulations and emotional metrics in PostgreSQL or Pinecone for retrieval and analysis.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Metrics Dashboard",\n      "description": "Interactive dashboard with radial charts and sliders visualizing emotional health, career, finances, and relationships for each timeline.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "MirrorChat",\n      "description": "Chat interface with AI-generated characters from the simulated timeline, including voice-to-text input via Whisper API.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Dreamlike Animations",\n      "description": "Fluid, immersive page transitions and starfield effects using Framer Motion for a cinematic experience.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Memory Poem",\n      "description": "Optional GPT-generated poem summarizing the emotional arc of the simulated life.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Rewind & Reroll",\n      "description": "Allows users to tweak a decision and re-run the simulation for comparison.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Immersive Audio",\n      "description": "Optional ambient sci-fi music and binaural tones for enhanced immersion.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    }\n  ],\n  "techStack": {\n    "frontend": [\n      "React JS"\n    ],\n    "backend": [\n      "None"\n    ],\n    "language": [\n      "JavaScript (ES6+)"\n    ]\n  },\n  "colors": {\n    "primary": "#1a1333",\n    "secondary": "#2d1e4f",\n    "accent": "#00ffe7"\n  },\n  "theme": "auto",\n  "layoutDescription": "The app features a full-screen landing page with a shimmering galaxy background, central \'What if...\' prompt, and generate button. The simulation output page is split-screen: narrative timeline (left) and AI-generated visuals (right). The metrics dashboard uses interactive radial charts and sliders for life statistics. MirrorChat offers a sleek chat interface with voice input. All pages use fluid, dr